* A4a one-channel parameters (stage 2, bias, ladders).  One parameter per line (scripts/ngrun.sh overrides by name).  Stage-1 sizing: ota1_params.spice.
* Supply and references.  VOCM = VOUT_CM = 1.65 V (Decision 17: VREF = VDD, mid-scale VDD/2).  A4b: VCM_IN = 1.65 V = VOCM (was 1.5 V in A3/A4a): with both references at VDD/2 the
* supply-to-output gain at 50-60 Hz drops from 1.02 to ~0.57 V/V (ideal ratiometric 0.5; Decision 21c, sim/a4b_psrrpath.log).  VTT2 = 0.9 V (was 0.2): see sim/a4b_thd_vtt*.log.
.param VDDN=3.3
.param VCM_IN=1.65
.param VOCM=1.65
.param VTT=0.2
* A4b: stage-2 pseudo-R gate offset (ladder B tap vg2 = vcm_out + VTT2); stage 1 keeps VTT.
.param VTT2=0.9
.param ILAD=2u
* Beta-multiplier master (bias_gen): poly resistor 1k/sq, width 2u, length RB_L (60 kOhm nominal at 120u).
.param RB_L=120u
* Per-channel mirror legs on vbn (unit = 16u/4u NMOS = the master Mn1): OTA1 sink x KS1, stage-2 follower sink x KSF.
.param BM_KS1=24
.param BM_KSF=6
* MIM sizing (same PDK area+perimeter formula as stage1.spice, square side solved for the requested C, typical corner)
.param CAPK_A=1.99e-3 CAPK_P=2.383e-10
* Stage-2 OTA (NMOS pair, PMOS mirror load, NMOS follower).  Tail ~ 1/80 of the master, pair at the same current density.
.param OTA2_WT=1u
.param OTA2_LT=20u
.param OTA2_WP=1u
.param OTA2_LP=40u
.param OTA2_WL=1u
.param OTA2_LL=20u
.param OTA2_WF=10u
.param OTA2_LF=2u
* Stage 2 capacitors: gain = CIN2/CF2 = 10; CC2 = dominant-pole cap on the OTA output node o2 (to vss).
.param CIN2=3p
.param CF2V=0.294p
.param CC2=2.0p
* Stage 1 feedback capacitor (CIN_RATIO x CF1V = Cin); A3 used 200f, the pseudo-R/switch parasitic is absorbed by trimming CF1V.
.param CF1V=200f
.param CIN_RATIO=100
* MIM side lengths from the requested capacitances (square, typical formula C = A L^2 + 4 P L)
.param LCC2='(-4*CAPK_P+sqrt(16*CAPK_P*CAPK_P+4*CAPK_A*CC2))/(2*CAPK_A)'
.param LCIN2='(-4*CAPK_P+sqrt(16*CAPK_P*CAPK_P+4*CAPK_A*CIN2))/(2*CAPK_A)'
.param LCF2='(-4*CAPK_P+sqrt(16*CAPK_P*CAPK_P+4*CAPK_A*CF2V))/(2*CAPK_A)'
.param LCF1='(-4*CAPK_P+sqrt(16*CAPK_P*CAPK_P+4*CAPK_A*CF1V))/(2*CAPK_A)'
.param LCIN1='(-4*CAPK_P+sqrt(16*CAPK_P*CAPK_P+4*CAPK_A*CIN_RATIO*CF1V))/(2*CAPK_A)'
* Pseudo-resistor device size (A2: 1u/2u PMOS pair), used in both stages
.param PRW=1u PRL=2u
* loop-gain break sources in stage1r/stage2 only when LOOPTEST=1 (tb_afe_1ch_loop.spice); otherwise a 100 Ohm noiseless resistor (a 0 V source's ~1e-20 A branch current made .tran abort randomly)
.param LOOPTEST=0
